<p> Residual Fuel...............852.......896.....-4.9</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,553.....1,571.....-1.1</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,703.....4,523......4.0</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,365....18,144......1.2</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,439.....6,502.....-1.0</p>
